# Obsidian view routing (abc blocks)

Before editing view detection, render paths, or Live Preview vs Reading shells, read **`docs/DESIGN.md` → Agent development notes** (`#agent-development-notes`).

## Required

- Route via `detectAbcBlockViewMode(app, el)` in `src/plugin/view-mode.ts` — do not invent new DOM checks inline.
- Reading → `render-reading.ts`. Live Preview → `render-live-preview.ts`. Source mode: processor must not run (no CodeMirror overlay).

## Do not

```ts
// ❌ Live Preview embeds are NOT reliably under this selector.
if (el.closest('.markdown-source-view')) return 'live-preview';
```

```ts
// ❌ getMode() === 'preview' is true for both Reading and Live Preview.
view.getMode() === 'preview'
```

## Quick check after changes

Live Preview (click outside fence): dashed border, editor stub. Reading: solid border, static placeholder. Source: raw fence only, no `abc-blocks-*` DOM.

Full rationale, CSS classes, and phase hooks: `docs/DESIGN.md#agent-development-notes`.
